      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "IRINKA FRED (8) caught the eye with a fast early split last time and setting up a 2.25 lengths win at this track over 318m in 18.38, making it two wins on end. Hard to go past. PINK MILK (4) was out of the placings last time but before that was an impressive winner (18.32) in a Grade 5 at this track. Safe beginner but tricky box to overcome. Can turn it around this time. FEAR NOT FRANKY (7) has a strong record this track and trip with six wins and six placings from 18 starts. Comes off a (18.53) win last time, scoring by 2 lengths in a Grade 4 over 318m at this track. Looks one of the chances. GLADSTONE BAG (2) was well backed last start but ran below expectations when sixth (18.97), beaten 8 lengths. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from four attempts.",
